# Data Formatting

Use `@/lib/formatting` for all rendered values. Do not call `toFixed`, ad-hoc date strings, or local empty glyphs in components.

| Kind | Helper | Example |
|---|---|---|
| UTR | `formatUtr` | `11.63` |
| WTN | `formatWtn` | `10.05` |
| Percent | `formatPercent` | `78.4%` |
| GPA | `formatGpa` | `3.57` |
| Date | `formatDate` | `Aug 5, 2026` |
| Time | `formatTime` | `3:30 PM` |
| Empty / text | `formatDisplay` / `EMPTY_VALUE` | `—` |

Presentation only — keep raw values for sort, filter, search, and persistence.
